<div id="collapseCitation" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="citation" data-parent="#idbox"><div class="card-body"><ul class="unstyled"><li>Cite as: Sakurai, Keizo (2018). Partial pressure of carbon dioxide, salinity, temperature and other variables collected from surface underway observations using carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer, shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous CO2 measurement and other instruments from R/V Ryofu Maru III in the Pacific Ocean and East China Sea from 2016-01-07 to 2016-12-21 (NCEI Accession 0173839). [indicate subset used]. NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.7289/v59g5k4f. Accessed [date].</li></ul></div></div>
